meta {
  name: Readiness (/ready)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/ready
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Real dependency checks (OpenEMR FHIR /metadata, the LLM provider base URL, the observability
  backend) - PRD.md §13.1's "Dependency down" row. 200 when every dependency is reachable, 503
  when any one is down (NFR-HEALTH-1). No status assertion here since the expected result
  legitimately depends on whether the environment's dependencies are actually up when this runs -
  see HealthEndpointReadinessTests for the automated fault-injection version of this check.
}
